        <mxCell id="env_local" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 1: Local Development&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• DB Docker (&lt;i&gt;npm run docker:up&lt;/i&gt; → :5432) + Host Node (&lt;i&gt;npm run dev:backend :3001&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;dev:frontend :3000&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Ở localhost, &lt;i&gt;lib/api.ts&lt;/i&gt; gọi trực tiếp &lt;i&gt;http://127.0.0.1:3001/api&lt;/i&gt;; hoặc chạy trọn bộ qua &lt;i&gt;npm run docker:all&lt;/i&gt; (build local)&lt;br&gt;• Test Mobile QR qua &lt;i&gt;scripts/tunnel.js&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;cloudflared :443 → :3000&lt;/i&gt;) hoặc &lt;i&gt;https-proxy.js&lt;/i&gt; (:3443 → :3000 &amp;amp; :3001)" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1100" width="518" height="124" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_ci" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 2: CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Runner cô lập (&lt;i&gt;ubuntu-latest&lt;/i&gt;) + service &lt;i&gt;postgres:16-alpine&lt;/i&gt; tạm thời (dữ liệu seed test) cho &lt;i&gt;ci.yml&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;ci.yml&lt;/i&gt;: eslint / tsc --noEmit → &lt;b&gt;prisma migrate deploy&lt;/b&gt; → seed → Jest Unit &amp;amp; test:e2e → nest &amp;amp; next build&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;cd.yml&lt;/i&gt;: Quality Gate (lint, Unit, build) → build &amp;amp; push &lt;i&gt;ghcr.io&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;brewlite-web&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;brewlite-api&lt;/i&gt;) → Hook / Compose Smoke Test" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="558" y="1100" width="522" height="124" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_prod" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 3: Production (Isolated Boundaries / PaaS Option)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Chỉ mở &lt;b&gt;HTTPS :443 (TLS 1.3)&lt;/b&gt; qua Edge Proxy / Cloudflare tới &lt;i&gt;brewlite_frontend :3000&lt;/i&gt; (hoặc Vercel + Render &lt;i&gt;render.yaml&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Chặn công khai port 3001 &amp;amp; 5432 khi lên Prod (Firewall / Override compose); giao tiếp nội bộ qua &lt;i&gt;brewlite_network&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Volume bền vững &lt;i&gt;brewlite_postgres_data&lt;/i&gt;, GitHub/Host Secrets, &lt;i&gt;/api/health&lt;/i&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;i&gt;AllExceptionsFilter&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100" y="1100" width="520" height="124" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
